      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. these are good. can u expand on point 5 for me? i want to argue that the whole concept of gentle parenting is basically just an attempt to dismantle the natural authority parents should have, making it harder for kids to function in society. can u write a paragraph for my script that explains how this shift away from authority actually harms a child's ability to respect rules and leaders later in life?",
